{"id":"7d71608bc30daeda","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md","title":"ZFC Analysis2 Locally Convex Space","display":"df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space — ZFC Analysis2 Locally Convex Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space"],"display":"df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space — ZFC Analysis2 Locally Convex Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-vector-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm]]","[[58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space — ZFC Analysis2 Locally Convex Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c479712ed846dd17\" href=\"?note=c479712ed846dd17\" title=\"58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm\">58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"710947804f01df45\" href=\"?note=710947804f01df45\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base\">58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2Seminorm}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2Seminorm}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4TopologyGeneratedByBase}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4TopologyGeneratedByBase}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb F}\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb F}\\)</span> (vector-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2Seminorm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2Seminorm}_S\\)</span> (seminorm predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c479712ed846dd17\" href=\"?note=c479712ed846dd17\" title=\"58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm\">58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4TopologyGeneratedByBase}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4TopologyGeneratedByBase}_S\\)</span> (generated-topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"710947804f01df45\" href=\"?note=710947804f01df45\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base\">58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}locally\\text{-}convex\\text{-}space}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb F}(X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\n\\land\\mathcal P\\subseteq(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^X\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2Seminorm}_S(p,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\mathcal B=\n\\left\\{\n\\left\\{+_X(x,y):y\\in X\\land\\forall p\\in F\\;\\bigl(p(y)&lt;\\varepsilon(p)\\bigr)\\right\\}:\n\\begin{array}{l}\nx\\in X,\\ F\\in[\\mathcal P]^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\[-2pt]\n\\varepsilon\\in(\\mathbb R_{&gt;0})^F\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{66pt}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop4TopologyGeneratedByBase}_S(X,\\mathcal B,\\tau)\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}locally\\text{-}convex\\text{-}space}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal P,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb F}(X,+_X,\\cdot_X)\n\\land\\mathcal P\\subseteq(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^X\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2Seminorm}_S(p,X,\\mathbb F,+_X,\\cdot_X,0_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\mathcal B=\n\\left\\{\n\\left\\{+_X(x,y):y\\in X\\land\\forall p\\in F\\;\\bigl(p(y)&lt;\\varepsilon(p)\\bigr)\\right\\}:\n\\begin{array}{l}\nx\\in X,\\ F\\in[\\mathcal P]^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\[-2pt]\n\\varepsilon\\in(\\mathbb R_{&gt;0})^F\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{66pt}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop4TopologyGeneratedByBase}_S(X,\\mathcal B,\\tau)\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topology is explicitly generated by set-builder translates of finite intersections of seminorm balls; the former expression tried to add a vector directly to a set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm","status":"resolved","id":"c479712ed846dd17","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base","status":"resolved","id":"710947804f01df45","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb F}$ (vector-space predicate, see [[58-df-vector-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-seminorm","status":"resolved","id":"c479712ed846dd17","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Zf