,\\mathcal B,\\tau)\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2214,"backlinks":[{"id":"34a7e79edd9f7f6e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aa0209ba799780d1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e7d979873300d8d4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ (生成局部凸拓扑的半范数族, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md]])"},{"id":"e23036035ed4df55","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b1484ba48c364679","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"96ccbb39b5f81246","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"973416abd14c9783","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2LocallyConvexSpace}_S$（局部凸空间谓词，见 [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md]]）"},{"id":"5ea835b976feaaff","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1449","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space.md|58-df-zfc-analysis2-locally-convex-space]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","592f9cfb66a507c2","c479712ed846dd17","710947804f01df45"]}